  "title": "Configuration unavailable at request time",
  "scenario": "happy_path",
  "question": "A hosted query cannot obtain runtime configuration. Identify the exception translation visible in this helper and request the missing configuration details. Do not infer the provider is down.",
  "input": {
    "question": "A hosted query cannot obtain runtime configuration. Identify the exception translation visible in this helper and request the missing configuration details. Do not infer the provider is down.",
    "version": "",
    "context": "# Frozen source excerpt: triage_desk/hosted_embeddings.py:85-92\n    def _runtime_key(self) -> str:\n        try:\n            key, _, base = _configuration()\n        except GenerationUnavailable:\n            raise EmbeddingUnavailable(\"Hosted embedding configuration is unavailable; no local fallback was selected.\") from None\n        if _embedding_endpoint(base) != self.endpoint:\n            raise EmbeddingUnavailable(\"Embedding endpoint changed after index construction. Create a new index so its cache identity matches the endpoint.\")\n        return key\n",
